          "fact": "日期：2026-06-30；标题：Into the Omniverse: Three Workflows for Improving Vision AI Agent Accuracy With Synthetic Data and Fine-Tuning；原文内容：Editor’s note: This post is part of Into the Omniverse , a series focused on how developers, 3D practitioners, and enterprises can transform their workflows using the latest advances in OpenUSD and NVIDIA Omniverse . Vision AI agents are becoming a practical way to automatically turn video data from the physical world into operational intelligence in factories, cities, warehouses and transportation systems. That shi…；来源：https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/vision-ai-agent-skills-omniverse-metropolis/",
