          "fact": "日期：2026-06-30；标题：NVIDIA BioNeMo Agent Toolkit Brings Accelerated AI to Life Sciences Researchers in Claude Science；原文内容：Life sciences has entered an era of computational scale, and for more than a decade, NVIDIA has built the full GPU-accelerated computing stack — spanning hardware, frameworks, libraries, models, microservices and domain-specific tools — to help researchers run more sophisticated workflows and iterate faster. This week, Anthropic announced Claude Science , an AI workbench for science research that lets scientists con…；来源：https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/claude-science-bionemo-agent-toolkit/",
