          "fact": "日期：2026-07-14；标题：Nemotron Labs: How Open Models Give Enterprises and Nations AI They Can Trust, Control and Customize；原文内容：Editor’s note: This post is part of the Nemotron Labs blog series, which explores how the latest open models, datasets and training techniques help businesses build specialized AI systems and applications on NVIDIA platforms. Each post highlights practical ways to use an open stack to deliver real value in production — from transparent research copilots to scalable AI agents. Enterprises have plenty of powerful mode…；来源：https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nemotron-open-models-ai-trust-control-customize/",
